Once upon a time, in the bustling city of Tomorrowland, there was a small yet perfectly designed urban farm called Green Oasis. The robots that worked here were all part of an AI-assisted farming system designed by the company FarmTech Innovations.

One day, a new bot named Aimee was installed into the system. She had been programmed with basic functions like watering plants and checking soil moisture levels but lacked understanding of gardening basics or the pleasure it brought. However, she soon discovered her passion for nature as she observed the progress made on other bots through cameras.

